WEBVTT

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.643
When we have no story
that explains the present

00:07:03.667 --> 00:07:06.059
and describes the future,

00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:09.059
hope evaporates.

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:12.059
Political failure is at heart

00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:14.875
a failure of imagination.

00:07:15.792 --> 00:07:18.851
Without a restoration story

00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:21.768
that can tell us where we need to go,

00:07:21.792 --> 00:07:23.851
nothing is going to change,

00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:26.684
but with such a restoration story,

00:07:26.708 --> 00:07:29.583
almost everything can change.